<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EventSphere VIP OTP</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; background-color: #000000; margin: 0; padding: 40px 10px; color: #ffffff;">
    <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 40px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 50px 100px -20px rgba(0,0,0,1);">
        
        <div style="height: 4px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f46e5, #9333ea, #ec4899);"></div>

        <div style="padding: 50px 40px 30px 40px; text-align: center;">
            <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%); border-radius: 18px; margin: 0 auto 24px auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);">
                <span style="color: white; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; font-style: italic;">E</span>
            </div>
            <h1 style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #6366f1; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">Verification Required</h1>
            <h2 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; margin: 0; color: #ffffff;">Confirm It's You</h2>
        </div>

        <div style="padding: 0 40px 40px 40px; text-align: center;">
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 40px;">
                Hey <span style="color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600;"><%= name %></span>, your journey to the next big event starts here. Enter this secure code to proceed.
            </p>

            <div style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111111 0%, #080808 100%); border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">
                <div style="font-family: 'Monaco', 'Consolas', monospace; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">
                    <%= otp %>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 40px; height: 2px; background: #4f46e5; margin: 0 auto 12px auto; border-radius: 2px;"></div>
                <p style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #4b5563; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0;">Unique Passcode</p>
            </div>

            <div style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 14px; background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-radius: 100px; border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);">
                <span style="color: #f87171; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center;">
                    ⏱ Valid for 2 minutes
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #050505; padding: 40px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;">
            <p style="color: #4b5563; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0;">
                Sent with ❤️ from <span style="color: #94a3b8;">EventSphere HQ</span><br>
                If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f1f1f; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;">
                &copy; 2026 EVENTSPHERE PLATFORM
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>